  "solution": {
    "text": "Normal vector perpendicular to the required plane is<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Equation of the plane through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Distance from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>"
